    "chunk_text": "Cnebba Iceling. Her Edwine kyning w\u00e6s gefulwad mid his \u00feeode on Eastron. Her Cynegils & Cuichelm gefuhtun wi\u00fe Pendan \u00e6t Cirenceastre, & ge\u00feingodan \u00fea. Her was Eorpwald gefulwad. Her Edwine w\u00e6s ofsl\u00e6gen, & Paulinus huerf eft to Cantwarum, & ges\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t biscepsetl on Her Birinus biscep bodude West Seaxum fulwuht. Her Cynegils w\u00e6s gefulwad from Birino \u00fe\u00e6m biscep in Dorceceastre, & Oswold his onfeng. Her Cuichelm w\u00e6s gefulwad in Dorcesceastre, & \u00fey ilcan geare for\u00f0ferde; & Felix biscep bodade Her Birinus fulwade Cu\u00f0red on Dorcesceastre, & onfeng hine him to suna. Her Edbald Cantwara cyning for\u00feferde, & he ricsode xxv wintra. He h\u00e6fde twegene sunu Ermenred & Ercenberht. & \u00feer Ercenberht rixode \u00e6fter his f\u00e6der.& Ermenred gestrynde twegen sunu.\u00fea sy\u00f0\u00f0an wur\u00f0an Her Oswald Nor\u00f0anhymbra cyning ofsl\u00e6gen w\u00e6s. Her Cenwalh feng to Wesseaxna rice, & heold xxxi wintra.& se Cenwalh het atimbran \u00fea ciricean Her Paulinus for\u00feferde se was \u00e6rcebiscep on Eoforwicceastre, & eft on Hrofesceastre. Her Cenwalh adrifen w\u00e6s from Pendan cyninge. Her Cenwalh w\u00e6s gefulwad. Her Cenwalh gesalde Cu\u00ferede his m\u00e6ge iii \u00feusendo londes be \u00e6scesdune; se Cu\u00fered w\u00e6s Her \u00e6gelbryht of Galwalum.",
